{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-13","kind":"proposition","title":"圆相切不论内外止以一点","englishTitle":"A circle does not touch a circle at more points than one, whether it touch it internally or externally.","book":3,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","contentId":"euclid-3-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2e4370520d3c57e9e7c5fbf3c538cc7b690bd1f71822d50bd682877486d8143","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-13.statement","euclid-3-13.proof.1","euclid-3-13.construction.1","euclid-3-13.proof.2","euclid-3-13.construction.2","euclid-3-13.proof.3","euclid-3-13.proof.4","euclid-3-13.proof.5","euclid-3-13.proof.6","euclid-3-13.proof.7","euclid-3-13.proof.8","euclid-3-13.proof.9","euclid-3-13.proof.10","euclid-3-13.conclusion","euclid-3-13.historical.1","euclid-3-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f891c6d1849c75bd05980e83317e409e4260a74e40dc3c70c1f977d6f1ea70a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A circle does not touch a circle at more points than one, whether it touch it internally or externally."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆不触碰一个圆,无论在内部还是外部。（相关点与线段：A）"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜相切不论内外止以一点"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆相切，无论是内切还是外切，都仅限于一个点"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"303f8227a20e90b21a4a2db7e85bb8128929e07383d3b8ad4c74b0604a8dac4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let the circle ABDC touch the circle EBFD, first internally, at more points than one, namely D, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,让ABDC圆触摸EBFD圆,首先在内部,多一点,即D,B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1ab948591a1db4d2de80cc10316d6f8cab5c272bee1fdbd19221fbc454edd7f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the centre G of the circle ABDC, and the centre H of EBFD, be taken."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABDC圈G中心,EBFD中心H中心,请让开。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c9ee5380b0bd09e9af577fe2068baaaa5c25880069088434f4e0f6c3be93f7a","citations":["euclid-3-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line joined from G to H will fall on B, D. [[III. 11](/principles/euclid-3-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,连接G至H的直线将相交B、D。 [[III. 11](/principles/euclid-3-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2a3d6fda8b6869a08c81acbbaa07f1bfd4843f25fc83f82004f8b59b98103e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it so fall, as BGHD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它落下,BGHD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7f1dddac4bad8adc02dd7e251b8e5463b151832afbb5e27609988451acef8ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the point G is the centre of the circle ABCD, BG is equal to GD; therefore BG is greater than HD; therefore BH is much greater than HD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G点是ABCD点的中心,BG点等于GD点,因此BG点大于HD点,因此BH点大大大于HD点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33d8461c9ab2726b4b66f1fbe855915791b1641f4c7754487a06ca169a8c8a9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point H is the centre of the circle EBFD, BH is equal to HD; but it was also proved much greater than it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于H点是EBFD点的中心,BH点等于HD点,但事实证明,这也比它更大:这是不可能做到的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90a7c063d5887cc6981a871b2f3975ddbc0576208e573f0904fb01eb3f698031","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a circle does not touch a circle internally at more points than one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,圆在内部不触动多点的圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5afa8fb8d26736013c954b8d9dda01dd4f6810ea2cd4770a8c3e3dc07ed3c20","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say further that neither does it so touch it externally."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我进一步说,它也不从外部触及。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"194ad6c1f27b614569cf19a30ee4861b8e83f812154886e11e08b17ca794f3b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let the circle ACK touch the circle ABDC at more points than one, namely A, C, and let AC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,让ACK圆在超过1个点即A,C点触摸ABDC圆,让AC圈连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bb80e96295936827dc303f1396b32c737df8de938c922fc0c9fa3a365e80748","citations":["euclid-3-2","euclid-3-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since on the circumference of each of the circles ABDC, ACK two points A, C have been taken at random, the straight line joining the points will fall within each circle; [[III. 2](/principles/euclid-3-2)] but it fell within the circle ABCD and outside ACK [[III. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-3-def-3)]: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于每个圆圈的环形圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈圈（相关点与线段：ABDC、ACK、A、C、ABCD） [[III. 2](/principles/euclid-3-2)] [[III. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-3-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c26c5aca95cabc8dc9b52c61999bd405ca0f8fded8787d0f7bc7f91581874e50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a circle does not touch a circle externally at more points than one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,圆不触动外部不止一个点的圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84c118df8cc4f44c09786e4cb93ae69148e32980f16ffced1650e1770455828b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was proved that neither does it so touch it internally."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"事实证明,它也没有在内部触及它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8bccdb36c4186ecb0b0d5825c3c1d4be0121260c76e6779ae015f6ed6588f62","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜相切不论内外止以一点先论曰甲乙丙丁与甲戊丙己两圜内相切若云有两点相切于甲又于丙令作直线函两圜心庚辛引出之如前图宜至相切之甲之丙〈本篇十一〉则甲丙为两圜之同径矣而此径线者两平分于庚又两平分于辛何也〈一直线止以一点两平分〉若云庚辛引出直线一抵甲一截两圜之界于癸于壬即如后图令从两心各作直线至又相切之丙次问之甲乙丙丁圜之心为庚邪辛邪如曰庚也而辛为甲戊内己之心则丙庚辛角形之庚辛辛丙两边并大于庚丙一边〈一卷〉〈二十〉而庚辛辛丙与庚癸宜等〈辛癸辛丙同圜心所出故〉即庚癸亦大于庚丙矣夫庚丙与庚壬者外圜同心所出等线也将庚癸亦大于庚壬可乎如曰辛也而庚为甲戊丙己之心则丙庚辛角形之辛庚庚丙两边并大于辛丙一边〈一卷二十〉而辛丙与辛甲宜等即辛庚庚丙亦大于辛甲矣此二率者各减同用之辛庚即庚丙亦大于庚甲也夫庚甲与庚丙者亦同圜心所出等线也而安有大小后论曰甲乙与乙丙两圜外相切于已从甲乙之丁心丙乙之戊心作直线相聨必过已〈本篇十三〉若云又相切于乙令自乙至丁至戊各作直线其丁乙乙戊并宜与丁戊等而为角形之两腰又宜大于丁戊〈一卷二十〉则两圜相切安得两点又后论曰更令于两相切之乙之己作直线相聨其直线当在甲乙圜内〈本篇二〉又当在乙丙圜内何所置之"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆的切线，无论是内切还是外切，首先按如下方法证明：如果 甲乙丙丁 和 甲戊丙己 在两个圆内相切，如果说两点与 甲 相切，然后在 丙 处画一条直线，并画出两个圆的圆心。庚辛 应该按前图所示画出。它应为切线 甲 的 丙〈本篇十一〉，那么 甲丙 是两个圆的同一直径，而这条线平分 庚 和 辛。为什么？〈一直线止以一点平分〉: 如果 庚辛 引出一条直线到 甲，两个圆在 癸 和 壬 的边界如下图所示。我们从每个圆心画一条直线到 丙，然后 丙 问：如果 甲乙丙丁 是圆 庚 或 辛 的圆心，如果 庚 是 庚 的圆心，辛 是 己 内部 甲戊 的圆心，那么 丙庚辛 是三角形的 癸 三角形的 癸。如果 壬 是 己 内部 甲戊 的圆心，那么 丙庚辛 是三角形的 癸 三角形的 癸 和 壬。然后，如下图所示，从每个圆心画一条直线到 庚 或 辛。如果 庚 是 己 内部 甲戊 的圆心，那么 丙庚辛 是三角形的 癸 三角形的 癸 和 壬。然后，从 甲 画一条直线到 甲，那么 癸 是三角形的 癸 和 壬。如果我们从 甲 画一条直线到 甲，再到 壬，然后从每个圆心画一条直线到 丙。接下来问：甲乙丙丁 是圆 庚 或 辛 的圆心，庚 是 甲戊 的圆心，己 是 癸 和 壬 三角形的 癸。如果 壬 是 壬 的圆心，那么 丙 问：甲乙丙丁 是 庚 或 庚 的圆心，庚 是 甲戊 的圆心，那么 庚辛辛丙 的两边都大于 庚丙 〈一卷〉〈二十〉 的一边，并且 庚辛辛丙 和 庚癸 应该相等。〈辛癸辛丙同圆心所出故〉 意味着 庚癸 也大于 庚丙。由于 庚丙 和 庚壬 是同心外圆，从 庚癸 的轮廓线也应大于 庚壬。可以说 辛 和 庚 是 甲戊丙己 的圆心吗？如果 丙庚辛 是 甲戊丙己 的圆心，则 丙庚辛 和 辛丙 中的 辛庚庚丙 两边应相等，这意味着 辛庚庚丙 也大于 辛甲。这两种比各自减去相同的 辛庚 使用，意味着 庚丙 也大于 庚甲。庚甲 和 庚丙 也是从圆心画出的全等线，怎么会有大小差异呢？后面的证明如下：甲乙 和 乙丙 在 丁 和 丙乙 圆心外切，两者连接一条直线。〈本篇十三〉 必须经过 〈本篇十三〉。如果说与 乙 相切，则从 乙 画一条直线到 丁 再到 戊。丁乙乙戊 应该等于 丁戊，且三角形的两条边也应大于 丁戊〈一卷二十〉。因此，这两个圆怎么可能在两点相切？后面的证明如下：此外，让两条切线 乙 和 己 由一条直线连接，这条线应在圆 甲乙 内，而 〈本篇二〉 应在圆 乙丙 内。这些应放置在哪里？"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-13.source","contentId":"euclid-3-13","revisionId":"euclid-3-13@raw-f2e4370520d3c57e","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c487a462b7da1986dfe74eb11e1e37548b921b40f0a273ca19458e5b9d9dfc5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-13:euclid-3-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-13.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"III. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-13:euclid-3-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-13.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"III. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-13:euclid-3-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-13.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"III. Def. 3"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-13:euclid-3-11:explicit","id":"euclid-3-11","book":3,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"内切两圆的圆心与切点共线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-13:euclid-3-2:explicit","id":"euclid-3-2","book":3,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆界任取二点以直线相联则直线全在圆内","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-13:euclid-3-def-3:explicit","id":"euclid-3-def-3","book":3,"number":3,"kind":"definition","title":"相切的圆：彼此接触而不相割","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
